## EVIDENCE TAGGING (apply to every material number and claim, in every phase)

- [D] disclosed by the company, with source and page (e.g., "Yuho FY03/2026, p. 12")
- [I] inferred or estimated by you, with the basis stated ("consistent with," "pointing to," "based on [source, date]")
- [ND] not disclosed anywhere you could find. Never fill a gap with a plausible guess.
- Never classify a customer, competitor, or segment (e.g., "hyperscaler supplier," "sole source") unless a source supports it.

